    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekieli ogokigita etukia yaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, imokia omoyio o birende omwoge, bwekigite etukia y’omotwe oo, ne chinderu chiao; erio orente ekerengero orengere etukia eyio na oyiatanane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensemo eyemo ya isato y’etukia eyio oyesambere gati‐gati y’omochie, ekero amatuko ay’okoyoboera kaerire; na ensemo ende ya isato oyeake n’omoyio oria goetanana ase omochie oria; na ensemo ende ya isato oyesiarere eirurukigwe nomwaga, na inche nin’yebwatie n’omoro one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oimokie etukia inke igo, oyesiberanie ase omokoba bw’eganchwa yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende oimokie inke igo korwa ase eyio, oyerute ase omorero oyesambe, na korwa ase eyio omorero norueo bwesiarere gochia ase Abaisraeli bonsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro Omonene agoteeba: “Oyo n’oro Yerusalemu; nayobekire ase egati‐gati y’ abanto b’ebisaku, ne chinse chinde chiyoetanaine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yerusalemu okorire ebibe kobua abanto b’ebisaku na bwangire koigwera amachiiko ane, naende okorire ebibe kobua chinse echio chiyoetanaine, ekiagera bwangire koigwera aya nachiigete, gose kobwatia emeroberio y’ane echiikire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya naro Omonene agoteeba: “Inwe mwabeire abebura‐buria kobua ebisaku ebio bibaetanaine, gose timobwateti emeroberio y’ane echiikire, gose timorendeti amachiiko ane, na timobwateti nonya namachiiko y’ebisaku ebio bibaetanaine.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya naro Omonene agoteeba: “Rora, inche ninche inde mamincha yaino, nimbaachere, ’mbanachere ekiina agwo ase egati yaino, ase amasio y’ abanto b’ebisaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho y’ogosaria kwaino gwonsi gw’okogechia nimbae egesusuro ’ntana korua kero kende gionsi, gose tinkonyara gokerua nonya ng’ake naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ekio abaibori ’mbarie abana babo, na abana ’mbarie abaibori babo, agwo ase egati yaino. Nimbanachere ekiina, na abatigari baino nimbasiarere gochia ase chinsemo chionsi chi’ense.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene Nyasae nigo agoteeba iga: “Ekeene, buna inde moyo ekiagera inwe mwakorire Obomenyo, bwane Obochenu bwabeire obotachenegeti ase engencho y’ogokora kwaino kw’obokaayayu, na okogechia kwaino gwonsi, nimbaserie kegima; eriiso riane tirikobarigereria namabeebe, gose inche tinkobarorera amaabera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensemo eyemo ya isato y’ abanto baino ’mbaitwe namarwaire agoita, na bakwe nenchara, agwo ase omochie ime, na ensemo ende ya isato ’’mbakenywe nemioro agwo ase chinsemo chionsi isiko y’omochie; na ensemo ende ya isato nimbasiarere gochia ase chinsemo chionsi, mbabwatie inde n’omoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase enchera eyio ning’umore endamwamu y’ane, na obotindi bwane, igoro ase bare, erinde ’ng’isaneke. Ekero ’ndabe naumoire endamwamu y’ane ase bare, ’mbamanye ng’a ninche Omonene nakwanire ayio inde ne risemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omochie, ningosirie obe amaturi na oyo ogochaaywa n’abanto b’ebisaku bigoetanaine, na ase amasio y’ abanto bonsi abagoeta ase ore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero nd’abe nendamwamu na obotindi na gokonachera ekiina na gokoa egesusuro ki’ogokorongeyia, aye n’obe kogochaaywa na gosekererwa, na ekero abanto b’ebisaku biria bigoetanaine barakorore, nigo barorokererigwe na goichanigwa. Ninche Omonene nakwanire ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ekio nindase abanto bao chinsara chiane chi’enchara, chibaite na kobasiria kegima. Ekero ndakore ayio ninkeyie endagera yabo bakoria ebe enke na enchara egenderere komenteka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nintome enchara ne ching’iti chi’orosana ase ore, ebio ’mbiite abana bao; boigo ningotomere amarwaire agoita na ogoiterwa kw’amanyinga amo n’omoro. Ninche Omonene nakwanire ayio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
